WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:35.990
Episode 4    Could You Please Tell Me Why?

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:41.990
Hey, Desumi!

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.350
Walk home with us!

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:46.660
Sure!

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:49.400
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.420
<i>Reaper Princess, A.K.A. Desumi Magahara,</i>

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:56.050
<i>is a teenage girl who hides 
her villainous identity</i>

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.090
<i>to attend high school in the city!</i>

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:03.060
Don't you have handicrafts club today, Desumi?

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.830
It's off for test prep today.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.020
Wanna go for some karaoke, then?

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.630
Sorry, I have work today.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.280
What, again?

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.190
You're a real workaholic, Desumi.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:19.110
You'll never get a boyfriend that way!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.580
A boyfriend...

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:23.940
Oh, a boyfriend...

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.830
We'll see, I guess!

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:29.630
Where's this coming from?

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:32.210
Hey, you got a crush on someone?

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.700
Not telling!

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.590
Hey, it's Red Gelato!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.990
<i>Fudo!</i>

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:42.180
<i>F-Fudo?</i>

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:44.890
<i>Fudo?</i>

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.310
<b>Shock</b>

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.310
<i>Fudo?!</i>

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.340
<i>I-Isn't that...</i>

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:55.800
Is that their new Pink he's with?

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.070
It is! She's so cute!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.150
You think they're dating or something?

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:02.570
They totally might be!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.200
They look really good together.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.740
Totally! A real perfect couple!

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:08.830
Right, Desumi?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.580
What's with the face?!

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:15.650
Huh? Desumi!

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:16.710
Desumi?

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:21.720
You rarely invite me out like this, Haru-kun.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.410
I'm s-sorry, Fudo-senpai.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.890
I know you're really busy...

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.220
Hey, not a problem.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.340
So, what was it you wanted to ask me about?

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.550
W-Well...

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:42.240
<i>It </i>is<i> rude to ask about this, isn't it?</i>

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.990
<i>But I just can't stop 
thinking about that photo!</i>

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:49.660
<i>Was that really Fudo-senpai?</i>

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.250
<i>If it was, that girl next to him...</i>

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.630
<i>Could she be... his girlfriend?</i>

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:01.980
<i>But is it really okay for me 
to ask about his private life?!</i>

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:04.990
I understand.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.530
I think I know what you want to ask about.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:09.720
Huh?

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:14.230
<b>For Those Seeking
 Muscle Growth

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:14.230
<b>Refreshing!
Goes down easy!</b>

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.380
I think this should take care of it!

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:14.230
Um...

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.480
<b>For Those Seeking
 Muscle Growth

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.480
<b>Refreshing!
Goes down easy!</b>

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.230
What's this stuff?

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:21.660
You've been with the squad 
about six months now, right?

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.300
Y-Yes...

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:27.760
You'll be hitting a wall with your 
strength training around now.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:28.240
What?

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:29.910
It's nothing to worry about.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.200
The same thing happened to me.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.710
What?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.990
Follow this training regimen 
over the next six months,

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:39.100
and you'll obtain a body 
of steel that will get you

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.440
through just about any battle situation!

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.130
W-Wait a minute, Senpai!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.620
What I'm actually concerned 
about is the picture—

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.470
You're such a worrywart.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.220
Don't worry!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.810
The book does use pictures to explain 
the regimen's trickiest parts!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.410
And this kind of incremental 
strength training

00:04:57.410 --> 00:05:00.220
is specially designed to minimize strain.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.960
It should be easy to follow, 
even for someone as small as you.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.820
Since training that harms your 
body defeats the point, right?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:09.660
It's also important to do appropriate 
stretches before each lift.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.440
The graphs about that here 
should be easy to follow.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.830
That will help increase the 
flexibility of your muscles,

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:19.030
and even promote swift 
recovery from injuries!

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:22.340
I'm not claiming you'll 
see results overnight,

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:23.620
<i>Now I know for certain...</i>

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:27.130
but anyone can get the body they want 
with sufficient application of effort.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:27.670
<i>Senpai does not have a girlfriend!</i>

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.350
No need to worry.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:32.970
When you make the call of effort,
 your muscles always answer!

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.350
That should cover it.

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:37.670
That's what you wanted to ask, right?

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.820
Oh, yes!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.360
Thank you so much!

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:43.400
<i>I'm sorry for doubting you, Senpai!</i>

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.860
They're calling us in!

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.400
Let's go, Fudo-senpai!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.090
Don't forget your book, Haru-kun!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.920
Here we go!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.120
Culverin Cannon!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.630
Culverin Cannon!

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.630
That's quite enough of that, Gekko!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.640
Freezing Sentai Gelato 5 has arrived!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.370
Underestimate us on pain of fire!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.040
It's about time, Gelato 5!

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:28.650
Today's the day I take you off the field!

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.160
Get them!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:36.950
Let's go!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:37.860
Right!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.210
All right, Desumi-san!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.340
What will we chat about to—

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.310
Red!

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:53.350
<i>Whoops. Guess my timing's a little off today.</i>

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.970
<i>It's okay. It happens.</i>

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.520
Let's coordinate our movements, Desumi-sa—

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.030
<i>I'll dodge your first strike, then leap back.</i>

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.530
<b>Ignored</b>

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.740
<i>Ignored...</i>

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:14.790
<i>That hurt!</i>

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:18.910
Desumi-san?

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:20.180
Desu...

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.130
L-Let's move this elsewhere, Reaper Princess!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:24.750
No!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:27.750
Take this...

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.050
Reaper Whirlwind!

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.470
<b>Reaper Whirlwind</b>

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.470
<i>I... I've never seen this move before!</i>

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:52.900
Desumi-san!

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:00.160
See? You shouldn't use moves you 
haven't practiced thoroughly.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.760
H-Hold on, Desumi-san!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.070
What happened to you?

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.670
Tell me what's going on!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.880
I saw you two in the café!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.080
I-It's not like that, Desumi-san!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:19.970
You've got it all wrong!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.020
I was teaching Pink about bodybuilding—

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.230
I know that!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:30.730
I know better than anybody 
that you'd never cheat on me.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:35.630
And yet, seeing the two of you together

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.880
sparked this hideous jealousy inside me.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.510
I found myself thinking,

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.580
maybe you don't belong 
with an outcast like me...

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.500
But with a girly girl like her!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.000
That isn't true!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:53.590
You're the girliest girl I know!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.840
Am not!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.600
I never used to be the kind of person 
to worry about that sort of thing!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.440
Love has made me weak!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:10.450
Dating you has made me...

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:17.450
A weak and pathetic mess of a woman!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.870
<i>That isn't true, Desumi-san!</i>

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:29.860
Fudo...

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.550
The person I am...

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.180
Maybe I'm just not...

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.650
cut out for love.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.750
I'm a pretty awkward guy.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:01.930
But once I make up my mind about something,

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.140
I see it through to the end.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:09.340
I will love you, and no one else,
 for the rest of my life.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.950
Will you trust me, and join me in that?

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:24.710
Yes, I trust you.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.950
That was rough.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.950
Why are you laughing all of a sudden?

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.490
I've seen an all-new side of you.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.180
You can be surprisingly negative sometimes!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.000
<b>Snap</b>

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:52.770
Fudo, I still haven't forgiven you 
for going on that afterschool date.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:55.870
W-Well, that wasn't exactly a date.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.130
It was just...

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.180
Promise me you'll take me on 
an afterschool date, too.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.640
Uniforms and all.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.640
Then I'll forgive you!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.950
I will! I promise I will!

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:16.200
Excuse me.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.080
It's all over, Senpai.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.960
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.230
<i>These two are busted!</i>

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.970
Love After World Domination!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.970
<b>The
Next
 Day</b>

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.310
Oh, w-well...

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.090
This is just...

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:00.070
Come on.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.220
Let's head back, Senpai.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:04.820
R-Right...

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:17.500
<i>That's strange.</i>

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.810
<i>She hasn't said anything.</i>

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:24.260
<i>Is it possible she </i>hasn't<i> figured us out?</i>

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.410
B-By the way, Haru-kun...

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:30.220
How much of our conversation did you hear?

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:33.090
After, "See? You shouldn't use moves 
you haven't practiced thoroughly..."

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.730
Or thereabouts.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.730
<i>Ah.</i>

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:39.180
<i>So, basically all of it.</i>

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:41.970
<i>It's over.</i>

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.470
<i>It's over.</i>

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.150
<i>It's over.</i>

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:46.750
<i>It's over.</i>

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.240
<b>The End of Justice
Reaper Princess  Steamy Affair  Red</b>

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:51.500
How could you have done this, Fudo-kun?!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.500
<b>The End of Justice
Reaper Princess   Steamy Affair   Red</b>

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.990
Utterly unbelievable!

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.750
How do you intend to atone for this?

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:58.750
I'm so disappointed, Fudo!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.730
How could you have done this, Fudo-kun?!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.730
Utterly unbelievable!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.730
How do you intend to atone for this?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.730
I'm so disappointed, Fudo!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.430
<i>If that's the situation 
that awaits me in there...</i>

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.650
<i>What will I do?</i>

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.190
What are you doing, Senpai?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.550
The meeting is about to start.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.410
R-Right.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.210
Good morning, Fudo-kun, Haru-kun.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:34.410
Hey there!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:38.630
Haru-kun would like to begin the 
meeting with an announcement.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.430
Yes.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.960
It's about me and Fudo-senpai.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.010
<i>It's all...</i>

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.470
Our end-of-term tests 
are starting this week,

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.390
so we'll need to leave early.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:49.460
<i>...not over!</i>

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.290
Tests? Boy, that takes me back!

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.020
Take care of yourselves.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:56.850
<i>Why?</i>

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.000
<i>Why did she do it?</i>

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.490
<i>Why...</i>

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:06.440
<i>Why indeed?</i>

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.030
<i>Why hasn't she said anything?!</i>

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:16.000
What in the world is going on?

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.060
I don't know, either.

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:21.020
Haru-kun has been acting 
normal for the past week,

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:23.500
both at work and at school.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:27.750
What are you scheming, Pink Gelato?!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.550
I'll bet she's watching us as we speak!

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:33.720
It's all right. That's why 
we're keeping our distance.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.690
Oh, it's just a civet.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:45.440
This is torture! I'm at the end of my rope!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.470
If she insists on forcing my hand...

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.360
I'll have to silence her forever!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.770
H-Hang on!

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.020
Hold it, Desumi-san!

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.660
No need to worry. I won't fail.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.120
T-That isn't what I mean!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.670
I'm sure Haru-kun has her 
own reasons for this.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.340
Let's wait and watch a little while longer.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:11.620
Fudo...

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.230
Would you mind buying me a drink?

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:20.390
I'd like a vanilla mocha, with nonfat milk,
 extra whip, and almonds.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.100
Vanilla mocha, nonfat milk...

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.200
Hang on a minute!

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.310
Let me write it down.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:29.970
Vanilla mocha, nonfat milk, 
extra whip, with almonds.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.070
R-Right. On my way.

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.110
Thanks.

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.190
Shown yourself at last, have you?

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:49.460
There must be a reason why you're not 
telling anybody about our relationship.

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:52.830
Would you mind telling me what it is?

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.600
Fight me!

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.100
Uh?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.860
That's what I want!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.970
You'll accept my challenge, 
won't you, Reaper Princess?!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.700
No...

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.120
Second-year at Kokutei High School,

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.370
Desumi Magahara!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.870
H-How do you know about me?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:20.890
Here I come!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:24.330
<i>Change, Gelato!</i>

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:43.640
<i>Her fighting technique has a long way to go.</i>

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:47.310
<i>That's right. She hasn't been 
on the team very long.</i>

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.660
Can we stop this now?

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:54.030
Not yet...

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.150
I'm not finished yet!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>Why is she so desperate to...</i>

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:15.940
I'm glad you're awake.

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:19.350
You should probably lay 
still a while longer.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.710
I lost.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.850
You really are strong, Desumi-san.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.360
Please tell me. What are you after?

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:35.380
The reason I joined the team

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.300
was because I was in love with Fudo-senpai.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:44.870
That's why I started to 
suspect he had a girlfriend.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:50.170
But I never dreamed his girlfriend 
would be an enemy commander.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:53.770
<i>I see.</i>

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.410
<i>It's no wonder she hates me.</i>

00:17:57.370 --> 00:18:02.970
But she also happened to be someone I knew.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.150
Huh?

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:07.980
She was...

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:16.440
on that night, when I was attacked by thugs...

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.480
the one who saved me.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.690
Become strong.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:37.030
The person who saved me, 
and said those words to me.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.730
That was <i>you</i>?!

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.980
I never dreamed you'd turn out 
to be the Reaper Princess, either.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:57.080
To be honest... I thought that if falling 
in love really had made you weak,

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.960
then maybe I could steal him from you.

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:02.240
But...

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.990
But you're as strong as you ever were.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:07.670
W-Why?

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:11.500
You could have destroyed our 
relationship without any of this!

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:18.520
I saw Fudo-senpai smiling in 
a way I've never seen before.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.260
So I just can't do it.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:33.430
I don't have the right to 
steal happiness from the two of you.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.150
H-Hey...

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.090
Why?

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:04.050
Why are you crying, too?

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.660
I'm sorry, Desumi-san.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.950
I can find any of that vanilla almond 
thing you were talking about.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.530
Haru-kun?

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.470
What the...

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.930
Shh...

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.700
Pink Gelato came by.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.420
She's sleeping now.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.900
<b>Pale</b>

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:00.300
<i>Did you silence her forever?!</i>

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:49.180
I'm rooting for you two, okay?

00:22:56.810 --> 00:23:00.270
But if you give me the chance, 
I might just take him from you!

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:07.400
So, you'd better get along!

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:12.660
I know. We will.

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:17.570
See you!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:22.670
<i>I am a civet.</i>

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:25.750
<i>This is the preview.</i>

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:36.430
<i>Next Time: "Just the Way You Are."</i>

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 5     Just the Way You Are

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:39.420
Why a civet?!
